# Build context for tests/harness/Dockerfile. The image copies only install.sh, install-constraints.txt,
# tests/harness/guide.sh, and the staged wheel (tests/harness/.stage/), so deny
# everything and re-include just those paths — the repo carries multi-hundred-MB
# dirs (.git, .venv, .tmp, htmlcov) that would otherwise stream to the daemon on
# every build. Nested files need each parent dir re-included, then its other
# contents re-excluded (Docker .dockerignore precedence rules).
*
!install.sh
!install-constraints.txt
!tests
tests/*
!tests/harness
tests/harness/*
!tests/harness/guide.sh
!tests/harness/.stage
tests/harness/.stage/*
!tests/harness/.stage/*.whl
